sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser (your JS)
    participant A as Firebase Auth
    participant F as Firestore
    participant An as Analytics
    B->>A: signIn(email, pw)
    Note over A: verify pw
    A-->>B: JWT token
    B->>F: setDoc(uid, data) [JWT auto-attached]
    Note over F: check rules
    F-->>B: ok / error
    B->>F: onSnapshot(ref)
    F-->>B: live updates
    B->>An: logEvent("click")
